  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Adding the '+' character in URI identifiers seems to work fine, and properly decodes for PUTs and GETs for most ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "code"
        }
       ],
       "text": "Accept",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": " mime-types, but seems to mess up",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "the http interface to fcrepo.  The URI seems to be decoded twice, converting",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "the '+' as shorthand for ' '.  Other http encoded characters to not seem to be affected.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "attrs": {
      "language": "shell"
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "      version=6.3.0\n      docker image pull fcrepo/fcrepo:$version\n      docker run --rm --name=fcrepo --publish 8666:8080 fcrepo/fcrepo:${version} 2>fcrepo.err >fcrepo.log &\n      sleep 5\n     info_fedora=\"http://localhost:8666/fcrepo/rest\"\n     put=\"curl -XPUT -u fedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin -H'Content-Type:application/ld+json'\"\n     \n     for n in 'c&h' 'c+h' 'c_h'; do\n         encoded=$(jq -sRr --arg x $n '$x|@uri');\n         v=$(echo -n \"info:fedora/$n\" | shasum -a 256); echo $n $encoded $v;\n         curl -XPUT -u fedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin -H'Content-Type:application/ld+json' --data \"{\\\"@id\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"http://schema.org/name\\\":\\\"$n\\\"}\" ${info_fedora}/$encoded > /dev/null\n     done\n     \n     for n in 'c&h' 'c+h' 'c_h'; do\n         encoded=$(jq -sRr --arg x $n '$x|@uri');\n         echo \"=$n or $encoded =\"\n         curl -XGET -u fedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin -H'Accept:application/ld+json' --head ${info_fedora}/$encoded | grep HTTP\n         curl -XGET -u fedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin -H'Accept:application/ld+json' ${info_fedora}/$encoded | jq -r '[.[][\"@id\"],.[][\"http://schema.org/name\"][][\"@value\"]]'\n         echo '==html=='\n         curl -XGET -u fedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin -H'Accept:text/html' --head ${info_fedora}/$encoded | grep HTTP\n     done\n     docker stop fcrepo\n",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "codeBlock"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Results in : ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": " c&h c%26h f05fb5650f440c20c37bdf8491e1905e158c57dfe9113276dd8f67f171683541 -\n c+h c%2Bh b25add6aca7d68eae8a7cb6b7e08d79d4b6ee1206ad420200767a30e04675b68 -\n c_h c_h d8ccdb4e35bcbd4101541470052de60d15327ec5a5f852b03b9d032ee0b7044d -\n =c&h or c%26h =\n HTTP/1.1 200 \r\n [\n   \"http://localhost:8666/fcrepo/rest/c&h\",\n   \"c&h\"\n ]\n ==html==\n HTTP/1.1 200 \r\n =c+h or c%2Bh =\n HTTP/1.1 200 \r\n [\n   \"http://localhost:8666/fcrepo/rest/c+h\",\n   \"c+h\"\n ]\n ==html==\n HTTP/1.1 404 \r\n =c_h or c_h =\n HTTP/1.1 200 \r\n [\n   \"http://localhost:8666/fcrepo/rest/c_h\",\n   \"c_h\"\n ]\n ==html==\n HTTP/1.1 200 \r",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "codeBlock"
    }
